# Alice, Queen of Blood

> Alice is a drain-aura frontliner who wins fights by staying inside the enemy formation longer than their damage can hold. Pick her when the enemy team must stand near tanks or objectives to play the game. Avoid her when anti-heal, true damage, or repeated disengage can break the Blood Banquet loop before it pays you back.

