## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Oracle, Glowing Wand, Concentrated Energy, Brute Force Breastplate
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Oracle, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Thrill, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Glowing Wand when Use against sustain fighters or carries near you during Blood Banquet. Lifebane's aura suppresses healing on all nearby enemies, and Fortress Shield scales hybrid defense per enemy hero in range.; Queen's Wings over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when burst damage is dropping you low before the second Doom Waltz cycle.; Winter Crown over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against late-game pickoff comps where one stasis can buy time for your team to collapse.; Ice Queen Wand over Concentrated Energy when Use when mobile frontliners keep leaving your aura before the second skill cycle connects.
- Total cost: 10530 gold

Default EXP setup for ranked drafts where Alice needs Clock plus Oracle online, then burn and sustain to hold objective fights.

### Jungle Tempo Drain (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Clock of Destiny, Oracle, Glowing Wand, Concentrated Energy
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Clock of Destiny, Oracle
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Thrill, Seasoned Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Brute Force Breastplate over Concentrated Energy when Use when you are the primary engage and need movement plus control reduction more than extra magic damage.; Dominance Ice over Glowing Wand when Use when the enemy marksman or jungler is deciding Lord fights. Lifebane's aura suppresses sustain on all nearby enemies, and Fortress Shield scales hybrid defense per enemy hero in range.; Guardian Helmet over Concentrated Energy when Use when repeated objective setups require healing between fights without recalling.; Queen's Wings over Concentrated Energy when Use against burst junglers who force Alice low before her drain cycle stabilizes.
- Total cost: 10570 gold

Jungle variant that buys close-range clear speed first, then returns to Alice's Clock and Oracle sustain checkpoint.

### EXP Anti-Burst Control (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Dominance Ice, Winter Crown
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Oracle, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Glowing Wand over Dominance Ice when Use when the enemy sustain sits behind the front line where Dominance Ice never reaches it. The two Lifebanes do not stack, so this moves the cut onto whatever Blood Banquet is draining.; Brute Force Breastplate over Winter Crown when Use when the fight is about repeated movement and control resistance rather than one emergency stasis.; Concentrated Energy over Dominance Ice when Use when the enemy lacks attack-speed threats and you can convert longer fights into more magic damage.; Guardian Helmet over Winter Crown when Use in siege games where the main issue is resetting HP between Lord dances.
- Total cost: 10760 gold

Safer EXP setup for high-control or burst-heavy drafts where Alice must survive the first collapse before draining.

